### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
spec Op { fn value(x int) int }
type Add as Op { n int; fn value(x int) int { return .n + x } }
type Mul as Op { n int; fn value(x int) int { return .n * x } }
fn invoke(op Op, x int) int { return op.value(x) }
fn main() int { return invoke(Add(2),3) + invoke(Mul(7),5) + 2 }
```

