## Case: dispatch-inherited-default
id: "av.parity.1088.dispatch-inherited-default"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1088"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
spec Base { fn value(x int) int { return x + 1 } }
spec Derived: Base { fn delta(x int) int }
type Plus as Derived { n int; fn delta(x int) int { return .n + x } }
fn base(op Base) int { return op.value(20) }
fn derived(op Derived) int { return op.delta(20) + op.value(0) }
fn main() int { let p = Plus(0); return base(p) + derived(p) }
```

