## Case: associated-super-explicit-default
id: "av.parity.1088.associated-super-explicit-default"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1088"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
spec Picker {
    type Item
    fn pick(x Item) Item { return x }
}
spec Main: Picker { fn extra() int { return 1 } }
type Counter as Main<Item=int> { n int }
ext Counter { fn pick(x int) int { return .n + x } }
fn main() int { let c = Counter(20); return c.pick(21) + c.extra() }
```

